  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vaddla Mohan vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 18 November, 2021 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Honourable Sri Justice D.Ramesh Crl.P.No.6429 of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "A Crime in F.I.R No.299 of 2021 of Rapthadu Police Station, Ananthapur District, has been registered against the petitioner for the offences under Sections 270, 273, 328 r/w 34 of IPC on the ground that the petitioners were in possession of tobacco and tobacco products. The cases are being booked against persons, who are found to be either storing or transporting tobacco and tobacco products, in the State of Andhra Pradesh. The persons, who are facing such cases, have been approaching this Court for relief.",
